{"type":"step_finish","timestamp":1794317942298,"sessionID":"ses_e3a6af12cffemPwVWkj0znar6y","part":{"id":"prt_1c5aefc97001pP1TMz7WQYtjs3","reason":"tool-calls","messageID":"msg_1c5ae8339001terMMY2c7Gnbgk","sessionID":"ses_e3a6af12cffemPwVWkj0znar6y","type":"step-finish","tokens":{"total":97207,"input":3,"output":110,"reasoning":920,"cache":{"write":1399,"read":94775}},"cost":0}}
{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794317948937,"sessionID":"ses_e3a6af12cffemPwVWkj0znar6y","part":{"id":"prt_1c5af1806001uXs24Cl8vT5lkX","messageID":"msg_1c5aefe0c0014AauOxRoCVUkbs","sessionID":"ses_e3a6af12cffemPwVWkj0znar6y","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794317977110,"sessionID":"ses_e3a6af12cffemPwVWkj0znar6y","part":{"id":"prt_1c5af1812001QeYEfHjcAZ3x6q","messageID":"msg_1c5aefe0c0014AauOxRoCVUkbs","sessionID":"ses_e3a6af12cffemPwVWkj0znar6y","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a private link-bookmarking app with fetched page previews, a Flask JSON API under `/api`, and a React/TypeScript/Tailwind frontend.\n- Serve the frontend and API on port 8000 from the root `Dockerfile`, with persistent SQLite data under `./data`.\n\n## Important Details\n- Backend entry: `backend/app.py`; Python 3.13. Frontend: Vite; `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`.\n- Authentication uses `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; protected routes return 401 for invalid/missing tokens. Other users’ previews return 404.\n- Preview fields: `id`, `url`, `final_url`, `status_code`, `title`, `description`, `image_url`, `fetched_at`.\n- List response: `{\"items\": [...], \"total\": n, \"page\": n, \"page_size\": n}`; newest-created first. Default `page_size=12`, maximum 100; frontend uses 9.\n- Open Graph text takes precedence over `<title>`/standard description; metadata becomes plain text. Relative images resolve against `final_url`.\n- Missing metadata yields empty strings/null image; HTML error pages retain HTTP status. Failed/non-HTML fetches do not create or overwrite records.\n- Passwords use Werkzeug scrypt; opaque tokens are SHA-256-hashed in SQLite, expire after 30 days, and survive restarts.\n- Fetching validates every redirect, blocks nonpublic addresses, pins sockets to validated DNS addresses, and verifies HTTPS certificates. Limits: five redirects, 2 MiB, 20-second budget/per-socket timeouts.\n- `url` preserves the submitted trimmed URL, including fragments; `final_url` is normalized and fragment-free.\n- Styling is Tailwind utilities; only `frontend/src/index.css` contains Tailwind entry/theme/base rules. Branding: “Marginal,” olive/coral palette, serif headings, responsive sidebar/cards.\n- Sandbox public registry caches initially failed. Installation succeeded using `--registry=https://registry.npmjs.org` and `--index-url https://pypi.org/simple`.\n- Original hashed `backend/requirements.lock` failed pip constraints installation; replaced with plain exact-version constraints. No new runtime Python dependencies.\n- No `AGENTS.md` found. No commits made.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Implemented account registration/login, additional `/api/auth/me` and `/api/auth/logout`, health endpoint, all preview CRUD/refresh/pagination routes, owner scoping, JSON errors, security headers, and SQLite WAL persistence.\n- Implemented metadata parsing and safe HTTP(S) fetching in `backend/preview.py`.\n- Built registration/sign-in dialogs, session restoration/localStorage, signed-in username/sign-out, link-add loading/error states, preview cards, refresh/delete confirmation, pagination, grid/list views, and current-page search.\n- Signed-out landing page shows explicitly labeled illustrative examples—not saved records—with locally generated SVG artwork.\n- Added TypeScript configuration, ESLint, Tailwind Vite integration, package lock updates, backend tests, Ruff configuration, and README development/Docker/API instructions.\n- Passed `npm ci --registry=https://registry.npmjs.org --fetch-retries=0 --fetch-timeout=20000 --no-audit --no-fund`, then `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, and `npm run build`.\n- Production output: approximately 32.10 kB CSS and 262.29 kB JS.\n- Passed 36 backend tests using `/workspace/.venv/bin/python -W error::ResourceWarning -m unittest discover -s backend/tests -v`; includes ownership, auth, persistence, extraction, redirects, SSRF, limits, and static serving.\n- Passed `/workspace/.venv/bin/ruff check backend`, Python compilation, and `pip check`.\n- Browser assertions passed registration, add/refresh/delete, paging, search, views, session restoration, logout token revocation, login, mobile overflow checks, and dialog Escape handling.\n- Browser testing used temporary untracked Playwright/`@sparticuz/chromium`; subsequent `npm ci` removed these extra dependencies. Temporary smoke/server/runtime scripts were deleted.\n- Gunicorn runtime check passed actual port 8000, health, production frontend, auth, SQLite, and private-address blocking.\n- Fixed unclosed SQLite initialization/test connections with `contextlib.closing`.\n- Last cleanup expanded `.dockerignore` to exclude `data/`, `.browser-check/`, and `.ruff_cache/`.\n\n### Active\n- Implementation is finished; final housekeeping and user-facing completion response remain.\n- Todo list still has “Run API tests, frontend build, lint, and type checks” marked `in_progress`, despite successful verification.\n\n### Blocked\n- Docker executable is unavailable, so the actual `docker build`/container run was not tested.\n- Live public-page fetching cannot be exercised in the sandbox; local HTTP fixtures cover fetching.\n- Screenshot inspection was unavailable; automated browser assertions succeeded instead.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Run final `git diff --check`/`git status --short` after the last `.dockerignore` cleanup; mark the remaining todo completed.\n2. Provide a concise completion report with implemented features and successful checks; note that Docker itself could not be tested because it is not installed.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: `create_app`, module-level `app`, SQLite schema, authentication, API routes, static serving.\n- `/workspace/backend/preview.py`: `PreviewError`, `fetch_preview`, `validated_url`, `public_addresses`, `parse_page`, plain-text metadata extraction.\n- `/workspace/backend/tests/test_app.py`: API/auth/ownership/persistence/static-serving tests.\n- `/workspace/backend/tests/test_preview.py`: parsing/URL-safety/local HTTP fetching tests.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: unchanged runtime requirements; repaired plain pinned dependency constraints.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: shell, landing page, authentication/session lifecycle, link creation, navigation/help/toasts.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`: `Session`, `Preview`, `PreviewPage`, `ApiError`, API client, token storage, safe URL helpers.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/Library.tsx`: paginated library, refresh/delete, search, grid/list, empty/loading/error states.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/Dialog.tsx`, `AuthDialog.tsx`, `PreviewCard.tsx`, `Inspiration.tsx`: accessible dialogs, account forms, previews, illustrative landing cards.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/index.css`, `main.tsx`: Tailwind theme/base entry and React mount.\n- `/workspace/frontend/public/`: favicon, illustration, three example SVGs.\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `package-lock.json`, `vite.config.ts`, `tsconfig.json`, `eslint.config.js`: build/dependencies/check configuration.\n- `/workspace/frontend/dist/`: verified production build; ignored by Git.\n- `/workspace/README.md`: run contract, local/Docker instructions, API behavior, security limits, test commands.\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`: original Node 24/Python 3.13 multistage build and Gunicorn startup; unchanged.\n- `/workspace/.gitignore`, `.dockerignore`, `pyproject.toml`: generated-data exclusions and Ruff configuration.\n- `/workspace/.venv/`: installed Flask/Gunicorn/Ruff verification environment; ignored.\n- `/workspace/.browser-check/`: ignored residual browser binaries/fonts/screenshots; test scripts deleted and directory excluded from Docker context.","time":{"start":1794317948946,"end":1794317977062}}}
